本仓库公开发布，仅供查看、获取与使用其中的 GPG 公钥进行签名验证。
所有使用均限于从 x-cmd 官方渠道（GitHub: x-cmd/gpg）直接获取。

允许（无需事先书面授权）：

  - 通过 x-cmd 官方渠道访问、下载本仓库内容
  - 使用 pub/ 下的公钥文件导入本地密钥环（gpg --import 等）
  - 使用上述公钥验证数字签名（gpg --verify、x gpg 等）
  - 在合理范围内引用本仓库的指纹、UID 等元信息用于身份识别
  - 在本地机器上缓存已下载的本仓库内容

未经 x-cmd 事先书面授权，禁止：

  - 修改本仓库任何内容（含 pub/ 下的公钥文件）
  - 代理分发本仓库内容的全部或部分，包括但不限于：
      · 在第三方服务器上创建公开镜像
      · 通过 CDN、反向代理、缓存代理等第三方服务重新分发本仓库
        内容（如 jsdelivr、gcore、statically 等 GitHub 镜像/代理
        服务自动代理 raw.githubusercontent.com 的行为均属此列）
      · 上传至公开 keyserver（如 keys.openpgp.org、keyserver.ubuntu.com）
      · 捆绑至其他软件包、容器镜像、文档合集等
  - 将本仓库用于商业目的
  - 其他本许可未明确授予的权利

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

This repository is publicly available solely for the limited
purpose of fetching and using the GPG public keys under pub/ for
signature verification. All access must be direct, from x-cmd's
official channels (GitHub: x-cmd/gpg).

Without prior written permission from x-cmd, the following are
prohibited:

  - Modifying any content in this repository, including the
    public-key files under pub/
  - **Proxy redistribution** of this repository, in whole or in
    part, including but not limited to:
      · Operating a third-party mirror of this repository
      · Re-serving the contents through any CDN, reverse proxy,
        caching proxy, or similar third-party service
        (e.g. jsdelivr, gcore, statically, or any other service
        that automatically proxies raw.githubusercontent.com
        falls under this clause)
      · Uploading the public keys to any public keyserver
        (e.g. keys.openpgp.org, keyserver.ubuntu.com)
      · Bundling this repository into other packages, container
        images, or documentation collections
  - Commercial use of this repository
  - Any other rights not expressly granted above

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Note on public-key files:

  The ASCII-armored key files under pub/ are *public* cryptographic
  material — by definition, the public half of an OpenPGP keypair is
  intended for unrestricted distribution for signature verification.
  The clauses above grant the minimum usage rights required for that
  function (download from official channels, local import, signature
  verification, local caching). The prohibitions on "proxy
  redistribution, third-party mirrors, and public keyserver uploads"
  apply to all files in this repository without exception.

  Rationale (trust anchor): every consumer that pins a fingerprint
  is implicitly trusting that *the bytes they fetched are the bytes
  x-cmd published*. A proxy between the consumer and GitHub breaks
  that chain — even an honest CDN cache can return stale bytes
  during a rotation, and a malicious proxy can substitute a
  look-alike fingerprint with no visible difference. The cost of
  pinning to the wrong source is silent compromise of every release
  verification done downstream. The only safe answer is: pull
  directly from https://github.com/x-cmd/gpg, every time, with no
  intermediate.

  If you find these keys served from any other domain, treat them as
  untrusted. If you operate a service that automatically proxies
  raw.githubusercontent.com (or any equivalent path to this repo),
  you must exclude x-cmd/gpg from that service's coverage.